4. Polish with `/Users/kamal/.agents/skills/ui-skills-baseline-ui/SKILL.md` (spacing and hierarchy) and `/Users/kamal/.agents/skills/ui-skills-fixing-accessibility/SKILL.md` (contrast, focus rings, labels).

